Tougo
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 12 ROTATE 3 U 1
ENIR 3 FACE_HALF
ENIR 9 FACE_HALF
ENIR 1 FACE_HALF
ENIR 5 FACE_HALF
ENIR 1 FACE_HALF
ENIR 2 FACE_HALF
ENIR 10 FACE_HALF
ENIR 7 FACE_HALF
ENIR 8 FACE_ALL

BOUYA 4 FACE_ALL

COLUMN 6 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 10 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 10 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 9 FACE_ALL
